 "intro_html": "A Cantonese takeaway classic (not actually from Singapore): thin rice vermicelli turned golden with <b>curry powder</b>, with shrimp, strips of omelette, red capsicum and — here — chicken in place of RecipeTin’s char siu. It doesn’t look like many noodles; they almost double as they soak. For wide, spicy, basil-heavy noodles, see <a href=\"drunken-noodles.html\">drunken noodles</a>.",
